            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Apple Silicon (arm64), macOS 14 or later. This release is signed for development and is not notarized by Apple. macOS may block its first launch.

- Search shows one movie poster per title and release year, with separate posters for remakes.
- Watch lists available versions of the same movie title across release years, starting with the highest labeled quality. Each version shows its year and category, with its saved playback position when available.
- The movie detail button always reads Watch. The sidebar stops at the new maximum width of 276 points.
]]></description>
